# Mechatron Prime CI targets for sigil (Thelio x86_64-linux worker).
# One valid Nix flake attribute per line.
#
# test-all runs ./test — the same entry point a human runs — so CI and the
# local gate cannot drift (2026-08-13, after two days of hand-picked-subset
# checks proving exactly why that drifts). The granular checks (test,
# test-cli, test-symbols, test-conformance) stay defined in the flake for
# local debugging, but each is a subset of test-all; building them here too
# would re-run the same suites serially on a single-queue worker.
packages.x86_64-linux.default
checks.x86_64-linux.test-all
